    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Story</h2>One day, a fox girl and her frog friend find themselves on a mysterious island shrouded by darkness but for a few floating lights.<br>Torii gates, food stall lanterns, and neon signs give light and color to the island. Something is lurking in the shadows, inching ever closer...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065580/extras/b90d3bf1d2a880b4a6d47a642da30ce0.poster.avif?t=1728639606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065580/extras/b90d3bf1d2a880b4a6d47a642da30ce0.webm?t=1728639606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065580/extras/b90d3bf1d2a880b4a6d47a642da30ce0.mp4?t=1728639606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Game</h2>&quot;Kitsune: The Journey of Adashino&quot; is a 3D action/adventure game focused on the exploration of a mysterious island inspired by Japanese folklore. Kitsune, the titular fox girl, will have to go through exploration sequences and escape sequences where she is being chased by enemies.<br><br>In the exploration sequences, you will travel through the island, conversing with its inhabitants and kindling lights within shrines to reach new areas.<br><br>During the escape sequences, you will need to outrun the oni demons chasing after you. Kitsune can use light to temporarily blind these monsters, giving her enough time to find safe routes and hiding places. However, the number of times she can use this light is limited, and she has to recharge it at shrines.<br><br>Her light also allows her to banish darkness, find hidden paths, and run into more people to talk with.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065580/extras/2fecea3e2e74f96bbc4291bf269e42f3.poster.avif?t=1728639606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065580/extras/2fecea3e2e74f96bbc4291bf269e42f3.webm?t=1728639606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065580/extras/2fecea3e2e74f96bbc4291bf269e42f3.mp4?t=1728639606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Looming in the distance is the Tower of Muyo, shining bewitchingly with the lure of myriad stolen lights.<br>This is the tale of a long summer night, the night of the Jugoya harvest festival...",
